          marks: 5,
          context: 'Percentage of dark-coloured peppered moths recorded near an industrial English city. 1848: about 2%. 1895: about 98%. The Clean Air Acts from 1956 onwards greatly reduced soot pollution, and lichen returned to the tree trunks. 1970: about 90%. 2000: about 10%.',
