          answer: 'Jean-Baptiste Lamarck; the inheritance of acquired characteristics (use and disuse); Charles Darwin, who proposed evolution by natural selection.',
          explanation: 'Most errors in evolution essays are Lamarckian in form (organisms changing because they need to). Being able to name the discarded idea makes it much easier to avoid writing it.',
