          explanation: 'These two strategies address the problem of unsustainable forest use from two complementary directions — directly regulating and managing the harvesting process itself, and addressing the underlying economic incentives that often drive communities toward unsustainable practices — and are frequently combined in successful, community-based sustainable forest management programmes.',
