          explanation: 'This distinction is why a pyramid of energy is generally regarded as the most reliable and biologically meaningful way to represent the structure of a food chain, since, unlike a pyramid of numbers, it can never give a misleading, inverted picture of how energy actually flows through an ecosystem.',
