          prompt: 'State the general function of nervous tissue.',
          answer: 'Nervous tissue receives, processes and transmits electrical impulses, allowing rapid communication and coordination between different parts of the body.',
          explanation: 'Nervous tissue is composed mainly of neurons (nerve cells), together with supporting cells that protect and assist them.',
